--- !u!114 &1515329897
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1515329895}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3a017c5932398e46bcd6f1607b78ca7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  defaultBackground:
  - {fileID: 360026356}
  deadCreatureBackground:
  - {fileID: 820989655}
  - {fileID: 407389680}
  - {fileID: 1257727732}
  - {fileID: 1826358305}
  - {fileID: 1030930343}
  blackingOutSr1: {fileID: 529172512}
  blackingOutSr2: {fileID: 1261434288}
  blackScreen:
  - {fileID: 1877674825}
  wakeUpBackground:
  - {fileID: 565149780}
  - {fileID: 1172291088}
  - {fileID: 1189087723}
  reversedCaveBackground:
  - {fileID: 922788333}
  dynamicCamera: {fileID: 962921368}
  preFightDialogue: []
  defaultBackgroundDialogue: []
  deadCreatureDialogue: []
  blackingOut1: []
  blackingOut2: []
  bonePopping:
  - content: ACK! Ow... ow... ow..
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 517
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291408
  preKadeFadeDialogue:
  - content: "Tsk. You would have been better off unconscious. A lot less screaming
      if you\u2019re out. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 502
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291422
    - rid: 6522887070328291423
    - rid: 6522887070328291426
    - rid: 6522887070328291425
  - content: And wiggling. Try your best to hold still.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291427
  - content: Ah... Who... who are you? Where...?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291429
    - rid: 6522887070328291456
  postKadeFadeDialogue:
  - content: "Hold still, I said. I\u2019m resetting the bone, not trying to bite
      your leg off."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291430
  - content: And frankly, I should be asking you the questions.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291433
  - content: "How\u2019d you get this deep in the mountains in the first place?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291434
  - content: "And what, you decided to take on Ol\u2019 One-Eye alone?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291435
  - content: "You\u2019re either suicidal or a fool. Isn\u2019t the first rule of
      the NITES to stick together?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291437
  - content: Or has all that HQ hubris finally gone to your heads?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Argh... I\u2019m... I\u2019m here for my own reasons. That lizard was
      in my way."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291438
  - content: Tsk. Another one stubborn to a fault.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291439
  - content: "Look, now's not the time for secrets. This is Wastelander territory.
      So, I\u2019d recommend you start talking."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291440
  - content: Brace yourself, this disinfectant will sting.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291441
  - content: "Argh! Okay, okay! I\u2019m tracking something. A Waste creature. We
      call it the Princess Frog."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291442
  - content: ...The what now?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291443
  - content: ' Like... A frog creature. With a... a tiara, or a crown on its head?'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291444
  - content: "Right. Should\u2019ve checked for concussions first before asking questions... "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291445
  - content: "I\u2019m serious! I've got a tracker pointing me right to it. Maybe
      you just haven\u2019t seen it."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291446
  - content: 'So that''s the incessant beeping. Hell of a build, this glove thing
      is. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Whoever made it should\u2019ve picked a less irritating tone though.
      Tracked me right to you, too. \r\n"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But fine, let's say this amphibian exists. Why are you risking your
      skin for it?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291447
  - content: "Because it\u2019s been hoarding crystals. Taking them from all over
      the Tundra and bringing them deep into this mountain."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291448
  - content: "Something about that... it isn\u2019t right."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291449
  - content: "Hoarding crystals? Is that so\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291450
  - content: How long have you been tracking it?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291451
  - content: Two or three weeks now?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291452
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291453
  - content: Stay here. I can get a transport for you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291454
  - content: "And I mean it. If I can\u2019t find you, you\u2019ll bleed out. Got
      it?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5de3fd0a5c7a8a42ad635445ff9a378, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291455
  - content: "Name\u2019s Kade, by the way."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "\u2026 Jackie. Thanks."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  kadeAndOthersDialogue:
  - content: Hey, Captain. Need you for a minute.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 503
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291467
    - rid: 3492363892074217534
    - rid: 3492363892074217535
    - rid: 3492363892074217536
  - content: "*sigh* What\u2019s up now, Kay? When you call me Captain, I\u2019m
      afraid it\u2019s always trouble."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 501
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291470
    - rid: 3492363892074217537
    - rid: 6522887070328291469
    - rid: 6522887070328291468
  - content: "It\u2019s a rat. Slipped passed our scouts, near Ol\u2019 One-Eye\u2019s
      nest."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291471
  - content: A NITE? Did they see you? See any of us?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217539
  - content: She was dying, Rocky. Bleeding out. So I stepped in.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291472
  - content: Kade! Again? How many times are you going to go rogue!?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217540
  - content: Your actions have consequences on every single life in this camp.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And how many times do I have to remind you what our goal is? To save
      lives.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291473
  - content: You save one life and risk fifty! Everything that we've been working
      for!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "It\u2019s short-sighted. And reckless."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217541
  - content: Think of the big picture, Kade. Stop fixating on the small problems
      right in front of you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Then tell me. Say it\u2019s you who hears a racket by Ol\u2019 One
      eye\u2019s nest and finds a girl bleeding out in the dark. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291474
  - content: 'What does that "big picture" tell you then? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "To not take risks on someone else\u2019s behalf. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217544
  - content: "...Hah. How noble. That risk isn\u2019t yours to refuse either."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217545
  - content: "If your \"big picture\" can\u2019t hold down to the smallest problem,
      it ain\u2019t sound."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217546
  - content: Cuz those outcomes are the only ones that you can actually change right
      now.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217547
  - content: "And in the \u2018now\u2019, a girl was bleeding to death. So I chose
      to save a life."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217547
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Besides, she\u2019s not just a \"life.\" She\u2019s got intel."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291476
  - content: Hah, intel? What intel could she have that we don't, be possibly worth
      this?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217548
  - content: "The NITES have been quiet. We need to figure out what they\u2019re
      up to so we can prepare for them."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And something she said was really interesting.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291477
  - content: "She\u2019s been tracking a creature. Calls it a \"Princess Frog.\"
      And it\u2019s been aggregating crystals deep in this mountain."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291477
  - content: ' ...Aggregating? Stockpiling?'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217549
  - content: "Exactly. She\u2019s a NITE. So she has no idea what that means. But
      we do."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291478
  - content: "Entity X... It\u2019s waking up."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Or this "frog" is trying to make it wake up.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "What if it\u2019s a lie, some trick to make us expose ourselves? Scouts
      report that <i>that</i> Doctor is back on site."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "How could she possibly lie about that? She\u2019d have to know our
      current mission."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291479
  - content: "She\u2019s not lying. A bleeding girl doesn\u2019t have the energy
      for it."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291480
  - content: Then how have we not found this frog already?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291482
  - content: "...Fine. I\u2019ll have a word with Jay later."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291481
  - content: So we bring her in. We treat her. Get every scrap of information...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Excellent, I\u2019ll need a retrieval team."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...And then we silence her.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217550
  - content: "And hope the rescue party doesn\u2019t come across this side of the
      mountains."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Rocky...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291484
  - content: Tsk fine. Then we'll put it to a vote. And worry about that later.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217551
  - content: Kade. I already have enough things to worry about.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217538
  - content: "I\u2019ll get you your team. But I\u2019m coming with. I want to see
      this \"rat\" who slipped past the entire scout line for myself."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291486
    - rid: 6522887070328291487
  everyoneDialogue:
  - content: Hey, you. Wake up.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291488
    - rid: 6522887070328291489
    - rid: 3492363892074217542
  - content: Huh... wuh...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291491
    - rid: 6522887070328291490
  - content: Listen, we heard your story from Kade. About this "frog."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But one thing doesn\u2019t add up for me. NITES don\u2019t send one
      scout on a suicide mission."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217552
  - content: So, why are you really here? All this way into this god-forsaken mountain,
      all alone.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217553
  - content: "I... I\u2019m here to find someone. Or... what happened to them."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291492
  - content: "I know it sounds stupid. But... my Ma went missing here. A long, long
      time ago. I\u2019m here to find out why."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291493
  - content: Rocky, who had started to prepare the stretcher, freezes.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...Your mother? What... what was her name?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3492363892074217543
  - content: Ailin.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6522887070328291494
  - content: ..Ailin? Then you...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "...You\u2019re Jackie."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
